WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:04,060
Dad Yuyu wants to eat candied haws

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:10,960
OK, buy it for you

3
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,960
It’s so long that fish want to eat it too

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,960
Can your little belly hold it?

5
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,960
You can hold it in. The fish belly is awesome.

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:24,270
No, you still want to eat

7
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:28,640
The latter one

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,640
But uncle, dad bought a lot of delicious food for Yuyu

9
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,800
Come and eat together

10
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:38,940
You eat first. Uncle is not hungry.

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,940
This is too expensive. I don’t want it.

12
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,940
Take it if it's given to you
